  "body": "<!--\nThank you for contributing to the HTML Standard! Please describe the change you are making and complete the checklist below if your change is not editorial.\n-->\n\n- [x] At least two implementers are interested (and none opposed):\n   * Chromium: https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/g/blink-dev/c/Ra856pXE_1c\n   * Gecko: https://github.com/mozilla/standards-positions/issues/776\n   * WebKit is N/A due to not supporting `registerProtocolHandler`.\n- [x] [Tests](https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt) are written and can be reviewed and commented upon at:\n   * Chromium: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromium/src/+/4428674\n- [x] [Implementation bugs](https://github.com/whatwg/meta/blob/main/MAINTAINERS.md#handling-pull-requests) are filed:\n   * Chromium: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=1432881\n   * Gecko: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1827827\n   * WebKit: (No support for `registerProtocolHandler`)\n\n(See [WHATWG Working Mode: Changes](https://whatwg.org/working-mode#changes) for more details.)\n\nThis commit adds `payto` to [safelisted]. This was originally proposed in #9154 and the scheme is documented at [RFC 8905].\n\nImplementation is showcased on the [payto generator].\n\n[RFC 8905]: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8905\n[safelisted]: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/system-state.html#safelisted-scheme\n[payto generator]: https://payto.money/\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programmatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9155/system-state.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 14, 2023, 5:39 PM UTC (8da6073)\">/system-state.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/9155/1279623...8da6073/system-state.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 14, 2023, 5:39 PM UTC (8da6073)\">diff</a> )",
